# Ink Agents Index

| Agent / skill | When |
|---|---|
| **ink-component-workflow** | Adding/changing editor surfaces or toolbar pieces |
| **ink-code-quality** | Review — types/const separation, no magic values |
| **ink-release-workflow** | Version bump, CHANGELOG, build, publish |

UI work follows ForgeStack Developer UI conventions. Publishing follows `@forgedevstack/*` CI pattern.
Git branches from Jira: `{feature|bug}/{PROJECT}-{n}` (e.g. `feature/INK-26`). See `git-jira-branching.mdc`.
